{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_01",
      "hash": "45c432aa3fa8d7dc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「嘿～那邊的傢伙！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_02",
      "hash": "45c435aa3fa8dcf5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？「我說[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳啊，該不會就是\\n那個叫[VAR TRNAME(0000)]的傢伙吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0170_select_01",
      "hash": "d0d9c0d403d03387",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好厲害！我就是。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0170_select_02",
      "hash": "d0d9c1d403d0353a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "咦？你怎麼知道！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_03",
      "hash": "45c434aa3fa8db42",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "果然是這樣！\\n不愧是本大爺！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_04",
      "hash": "45c42faa3fa8d2c3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳長得跟爺爺形容的樣子\\n一模一樣啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_05",
      "hash": "45c42eaa3fa8d110",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「我是青綠！\\c\\n我聽大木爺爺說，\\n真新鎮又有跟我一樣的\\r\\n訓練家踏上旅途了。\\c\\n所以我就趕快來看看啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_06",
      "hash": "45c431aa3fa8d629",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "最強的本大爺我\\n本來還想給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一些建議的，\\r\\n沒想到[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳已經解決啦。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_11",
      "hash": "45c0aeaa3fa5c1b9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "看來[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳還挺有看頭的嘛！\\n這是給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的獎勵！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0170_red_01",
      "hash": "cfe03f2037f8e3dc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_07",
      "hash": "45c430aa3fa8d476",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 10]"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0170_red_02",
      "hash": "cfe0422037f8e8f5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 11]"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0170_dummy_01",
      "hash": "ad78127e34c878c1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從青綠那裡\\n得到了５個[VAR COLOR(0006)]超級球[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_08",
      "hash": "45c43baa3fa8e727",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「用超級球會比普通精靈球\\n更容易捉到寶可夢喔！\\c\\n……倒是，[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳那個\\n是寶可夢圖鑑沒錯吧？\\r\\n爺爺終於研發成功啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_09",
      "hash": "45c43aaa3fa8e574",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "想當年我去冒險的時候，可是用\\n鉛筆在地圖上記錄分佈狀況的……"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_10",
      "hash": "45c0adaa3fa5c006",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳就好好努力\\n幫忙大木爺爺吧！\\r\\n下次再見啦！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0170_max",
